[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15960.79, "timestamp": "04:26:00", "text": "你知道，那可就不好玩了，当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15963.83, "timestamp": "04:26:03", "text": "别觉得她怎么样。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15965.11, "timestamp": "04:26:05", "text": "假设你正在进行越野活动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15967.03, "timestamp": "04:26:07", "text": "现在这玩意儿。如果有的话，你会喜欢吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15968.95, "timestamp": "04:26:08", "text": "不要跳跃，也不要挥舞你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15972.79, "timestamp": "04:26:12", "text": "车？不，感觉不真实。确切地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15975.67, "timestamp": "04:26:15", "text": "是的。你什么都听不到，而且喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15979.75, "timestamp": "04:26:19", "text": "油门的声音听起来像个“d”音。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15981.429, "timestamp": "04:26:21", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15985.51, "timestamp": "04:26:25", "text": "应该有点劲儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15988.55, "timestamp": "04:26:28", "text": "试试开车或者像“是的”。刺激，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15991.429, "timestamp": "04:26:31", "text": "猜测。是的。是的。是的。刺激。刺激。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15994.75, "timestamp": "04:26:34", "text": "就是这个词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16004.149, "timestamp": "04:26:44", "text": "所以，嗯，你未来还有什么计划吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16007.75, "timestamp": "04:26:47", "text": "想……就像你想在……之内做的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16009.91, "timestamp": "04:26:49", "text": "社区以及您的频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16012.79, "timestamp": "04:26:52", "text": "内容之类的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16015.67, "timestamp": "04:26:55", "text": "嗯，我想做很多事，很多。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16016.02, "timestamp": "04:26:56", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "everything that can kills me makes me feel alive time thingy"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16017.83, "timestamp": "04:26:57", "text": "事件。我不会就此止步于两个。"}]